| **Score calculation** | All `if`/`score +=` blocks are hard to read and hard to test. | Break the logic into small, pure helper functions: <br>```ts<br>function countSpeakers(lines: string[]): Set<string> { … }<br>function hasAlternation(lines: string[], speakers: Set<string>): boolean { … }<br>function containsNegotiation(text: string): boolean { … }<br>function isInUniverse(text: string): boolean { … }<br>function hasRealisticDialogue(lines: string[]): boolean { … }<br>function hasEmotionalNuance(text: string): boolean { … }<br>```<br>Each helper returns a boolean. Then compute the final score: <br>```ts<br>let score = BASE_SCORE;<br>if (speakers.size >= RANKING.MIN_SPEAKERS) score += SCORE.SPEAKERS;<br>…<br>``` |
