| **Ajv instantiation** | `new Ajv();` | Simpler, less error‑prone. |
| **Unused variable** | Removed `reference` | Keeps the file tidy. |
| **Schema & types** | Exported `characterSchema` and `StarTrekCharacter` | Allows other modules to reuse the exact same contract. |
| **Constants** | `ScoreWeights`, `CallDefaults` | One place to tweak the benchmark – no magic numbers scattered. |
| **JSON extraction** | `extractFirstJsonFragment()` | Pure function, easily unit‑tested, reusable. |
