> **Why this works** –  
> Each `export * from …` line automatically pulls *all* named exports out of the target module. If a module only exports `styleTransferBenchmarkMeta` (and maybe other helpers), it will be part of the public surface automatically.  
> The file is now a single, tidy, read‑once list of statements.

