## 5. Implement BLEU / ROUGE calculation (light‑weight wrapper)

```ts
// src/benchmarks/longFormGeneration/bleuRouge.ts
import { computeBleu, computeRouge } from '../thirdparty/bleuRouge'; // your existing libs

export function calculateBleuRouge(
  candidate: string,
  reference: string,
): { bleu: number; rouge: number } {
  const bleu = computeBleu(candidate, reference);
  const rouge = computeRouge(candidate, reference);
  return { bleu, rouge };
}
```

> **Optional** – If you already have a library that returns a single score for a pair of texts, just re‑use it.

