| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `styleTransferBenchmarkMeta` is a single constant that could live in its own module | `export const styleTransferBenchmarkMeta = { suiteType: 'quality', requires: [] } as const;` |
| Unused `@module` JSDoc block | Remove or replace with a brief file‑level comment. |
| Re‑creating `new Date().toISOString()` in several places | Moved into the result factories. |
| `Record<string, QualityBenchmarkScore>` cast to `Record<BenchmarkType, ...>` | Now typed via `Partial<Record<BenchmarkType, ...>>` and cast after all keys are populated. |

