| 5 | **Centralise file path handling** | The file path is derived at import time. If you later want to override the path (e.g. via an env var) you’ll have to touch many places. | Move `BENCHMARKS_FILE` into a small config module (`storageConfig.ts`). Export a function `getBenchmarksFilePath()` so the test harness can inject a different path. |
