| **15** | **Rename long‑named variables** | `s`, `bench`, `s` make the loops hard to follow. Use descriptive names: `server`, `benchmark`, `job`. | ```ts<br>for (const [serverId, model] of this.inFlight) {<br>  const job = { server: this.servers.get(serverId), model, key: `${serverId}:${model}` };<br>  …<br>}<br>``` |
