## 9. Final notes / Checklist

| ✅ | Item |
|---|------|
| ✅ | **All duplicated code is extracted** (validation, error handling, NDJSON, “missing‑model” check). |
| ✅ | **Handlers are thin** – only the HTTP plumbing lives here; the heavy lifting is in `modelService`. |
| ✅ | **Standardised response contract** – makes the API easier to consume and to test. |
